    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "by K'arn Hollowbeak, Avian scholar\nTomb Guards are regarded by other Avians as weird or creepy. The reason for this is because they willingly volunteer to live in a tomb for ten years. What others don't realise, though, is that being a Tomb Guard gives one plenty of time to reflect, to create, to plan. Some of my best works were prepared during my tenure as Tomb Guard.",
    "value": "由翼族学者，K'arn_Hollowbeak编写。\n陵墓守卫被翼族视为怪异的存在，原因是他们呆在坟墓里生活竟然是出于自愿的。不过其他人没有意识到，作为一名陵墓守卫，却能有足够多的时间思考以及创造，所以我得在我成为守卫前准备一些我认为最棒的作品以供阅读。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Tomb Guards also have to possess exceptional physical and mental skill. While it's never been documented in Avian history, it's entirely possible that a large armed group could descend upon a tomb, set on stripping it of its riches. As such, we spend many years reading up on how to deal with such a situation, until we feel we're ready for anything.",
    "value": "守卫者须兼备武勇与智识。纵史册未载盗匪之祸，然珍宝所在，必引贪妄之辈。故吾辈皆倾数年之功，研习攻防之术，直至胸有韬略，方可镇守圣陵。"
  }
